0:00:06.240,0:00:06.940
Listen,

0:00:08.473,0:00:10.163
this isn’t about
charts

0:00:10.164,0:00:11.853
or early undeground pets

0:00:15.811,0:00:19.812
Edging around a
adult man energy

0:00:20.393,0:00:23.181
syrupy dots
to the softness

0:00:23.716,0:00:25.933
or melodic prettiness

0:00:26.722,0:00:27.422
Yeah

0:00:28.181,0:00:30.786
You weren’t born
with a “buy” button,

0:00:31.080,0:00:33.748
The terminal in swaddles
couldn’t open for you.

0:00:34.032,0:00:36.634
There was a call to
become more than you are,

0:00:36.695,0:00:38.286
It whispered
in candles,

0:00:38.287,0:00:39.876
in shorts, in
every test.

0:00:40.612,0:00:43.167
You thought freedom
was here, suddenly,

0:00:43.432,0:00:45.048
But the market
is a mirror,

0:00:45.049,0:00:46.477
a test for
your ears.

0:00:46.874,0:00:49.932
Cycles, schemes,
dumps, pullbacks,

0:00:50.002,0:00:51.561
In the loop you
lost yourself

0:00:51.663,0:00:53.105
- brother, know
these dates.

0:00:53.147,0:00:54.579
Not a trader,

0:00:54.601,0:00:56.048
not a player -

0:00:56.225,0:00:59.118
but alive,

0:00:59.820,0:01:01.865
Between the
entry points,

0:01:02.280,0:01:06.196
an empty heart inside.

0:01:06.459,0:01:09.463
Not advice, but
a cry, not tables,

0:01:09.963,0:01:13.651
but dreams,

0:01:13.723,0:01:14.789
Stay on the path -

0:01:15.233,0:01:20.406
something will
awaken within.

0:01:34.146,0:01:36.947
Trading isn’t a
profession, it’s a ritual,

0:01:37.532,0:01:39.283
Go through hell,
hear the silence -

0:01:39.303,0:01:40.436
that’s the signal.

0:01:40.735,0:01:43.517
No instructions,
only revelation,

0:01:43.557,0:01:45.955
Pain and drawdowns
- your understanding,

0:01:45.976,0:01:46.604
 your vision.

0:01:46.641,0:01:48.916
You can leave,
but stay with me,

0:01:48.960,0:01:51.626
Inside lives the
unbreakable,

0:01:51.657,0:01:53.222
 sacred, steadfast.

0:01:53.250,0:01:56.142
Not a trader,
not a player -

0:01:56.151,0:01:59.724
but alive,

0:01:59.787,0:02:01.845
Between the
entry points,

0:02:02.253,0:02:05.657
an empty heart inside.

0:02:06.474,0:02:09.499
Not advice, but
a cry, not tables,

0:02:09.882,0:02:13.466
but dreams,

0:02:13.554,0:02:15.127
Stay on the path -

0:02:15.224,0:02:21.678
something will
awaken within.

0:02:34.001,0:02:36.607
You entered the game,
but don’t lose yourself,

0:02:36.635,0:02:39.949
Look deep within,
ignite your own light.

0:02:39.997,0:02:42.690
Every drawdown,
every entry point -

0:02:42.722,0:02:43.236
a lesson,

0:02:43.342,0:02:44.391
Every short and long -

0:02:44.496,0:02:46.895
a step to your
living mind, brother.

0:02:47.511,0:02:49.900
No signals -
there’s only you,

0:02:49.979,0:02:51.404
No freedom
in the market,

0:02:51.405,0:02:53.244
but there is an
inner temple.

0:02:53.340,0:02:54.905
Wake up…

0:02:55.020,0:02:57.020
hear yourself
between the lines,

0:02:57.482,0:03:00.415
In every market noise,
your voice, your current.

0:03:01.078,0:03:03.578
This isn’t a
text, it’s a ritual,

0:03:03.705,0:03:06.635
Chronicle of life,
inner path - the finale.

0:03:08.119,0:03:11.268
Welcome to the
path, here is all yours,

0:03:14.039,0:03:16.115
No signals -

0:03:16.115,0:03:18.115
only the living.
